1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Someone is waiting by the door.
[a quiet stairwell]

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,000
First, confirm they belong here.
[a notebook page turns]

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Two thumbs, one mechanism.
[steel under tension]

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Find the resistance.
[rough brass friction]

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,000
That pin is set.
[a dry click under the thumb]

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A spool can fool you.
[a hollow double click]

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Ease the pressure.
[a slow reverse scrape]

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
When the lights go out, listen.
[two clicks in the dark]

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The bolt gives way.
[a heavy deadbolt clunk]

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
The door opens without damage.
[a quiet hinge creak]

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Someone's home again.
A game, not a course. The locks are invented.
